Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,735)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord1.8\1a&HFF&\t(684,726,\1a&H00&)\t(3145,3186,\1a&HFF&)}Enter: Nami
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(726,735)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Enter: Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the hell are we going\Nto reach land, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:02:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just sailing on the wind and\Nthe waves, going where they take us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you find it dumb that\Nsomeone trying to be king
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the pirates doesn't have\Na single navigational skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just drift around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you some famous bounty\Nhunter who sailed the seas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any recollection of\Never calling myself a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I set out onto the open sea\Nin search of just one man,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I couldn't\Nget back to my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By that point, I had no choice but to\Ngo after pirate ships to earn a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.85,0:02:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're just lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh heh, another big haul today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's two in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of this should keep Buggy\Nfrom getting too mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with that boat out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me i'm not dreaming this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding help out here in\Nthe middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're real, then please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you get me some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you as much jewelry\Nand valuables as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could just give\Nme one little drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sweat, we'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not until we see what kind\Nof treasure you're holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't mind us, we'll just be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get the damn thing open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold up, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can keep the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's our boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the look of those clouds\Nmoving in from the south,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say a cold front's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can probably expect strong\Nwinds and squalls any time now, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, in that small boat, and you\Nrun a bit of a chance of capsizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just take whatever\Ntreasure you guys got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I am so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, a bird. I\Nknow! Let's eat it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we catch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUM-GUM-PROCKET!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I find\Nshipwreckers at a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna have to jump in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually impressed\Nyou made it on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the boat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us are members of\NBack the Clown's pirate crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This boat is ours now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we had no idea you were\Nthe famous pirate hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you three idiots,\NI lost sight of my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just keep paddling. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing Luffy, he'll probably pull\Noff something once he spots land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, any ideas about what we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Captain Buggy finds out a girl stole\Nour boat and our treasure, we're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who is this Buggy guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never heard of Buggy the Clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the ruthless captain\Nof our pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's eaten one of the devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But above everything else, he\Nis one truly terrifying man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! I finally got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey girl, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better give us that map back or else\Nwe just stole that chart of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It belongs to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get that\Nthing back then we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be killed by one of\Nthe captain's cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spotted something high\Nin the sky above the pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, shoot it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.35,0:07:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy fell from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, why were there\Ncannonballs flying at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what just happened to me was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Boss! Thanks for\Ncoming to save me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all yours now, boss! Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that girl's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay! We've got her boss now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should've let your\Ncrony fit for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys know of anywhere\Ngood to eat around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food's the least of your worries now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better keep your hands off\Nmy treasure! – You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i wonder if they've\Nkilled that poor guy yet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow you're really strong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though both of them had sabers\Nyou beat them barehanded Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the girl who set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.33,0:09:00.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,482)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)\t(3688,3730,\1a&HFF&)}Nami, a Pirate Thief
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.33,0:09:00.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,482)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HE6E6E6&\c&HE6E6E6&\1a&HFF&\t(435,476,\1a&H00&)\t(3688,3730,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Nami, a Pirate Thief
Dialogue: 3,0:08:56.33,0:09:00.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,482)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Nami, a Pirate Thief
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a talented thief who\Nsteals strictly from pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, want to team up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, thanks anyway, lady,\Nbut I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least think about it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me they still\Nhaven't caught the thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, not yet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they should be in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, Captain, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.23,0:09:28.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Buggy "the Clown"\NPirate Captain
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.23,0:09:28.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HE6E6E6&\c&HE6E6E6&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Buggy "the Clown"\NPirate Captain
Dialogue: 3,0:09:23.23,0:09:28.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Buggy "the Clown"\NPirate Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now explain to me, how in the world did\Nshe manage to get her hands on that chart?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're preparing to enter the\NGrand Line and go on a rampage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then why wasn't the\Nchart properly guarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The map was just sitting out,\Nplain as the nose on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was easy for\Nher to find and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear something about my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you trying to tell\Nme you find my nose funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my nose amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sir, you misunderstood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you were quite clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna use the Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what happens if someone defies me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flashy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Await...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your groveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll overlook your slip-up\Nand forgive you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you better get that chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up again, or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do you live in this\Nbig house all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just staying here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's left this town\Nbecause of Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're just a petty thief. How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only steal from people\Nwho deserve it. Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't compare me to\Nsome scumbag petty thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thief's a thief as\Nfar as I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal is to earn a\Nhundred million berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how hard it\Nis or how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you need so\Nmany berries for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with this chart of the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hundred million is now\Na definite possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chart?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you must be a navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the most skilled navigator\Nyou're ever likely to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about you join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking to recruit a navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can be our newest crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose this means\Nyou're a pirate. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a solemn promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised the guy who\Ngave me this hat that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,form a crew and become\Nthe greatest pirate ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I hate more\Nin this world than pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only like money and tangerines. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be our navigator. I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.29,0:12:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find her or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't find her anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could she be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but we're going to be in big\Ntrouble if we don't get that chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to do something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I might consider joining you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but only if you'll agree\Nto certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then I want you to come with me to\Npay a little visit to Buggy the Pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to tie me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.73,0:12:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rope's just for appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to meeting\Nsome other pirates, so let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me the thief got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a more\Npathetic group than you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, I have news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl who stole our chart is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the sneaky thief who stole the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've captured the thief,\NCaptain Buggy the Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's your chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I don't appreciate it, but why\Nthe sudden change of heart, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had another fight with my boss,\Nand I just can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd see if\NI could join your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit you're an amusing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can join my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've successfully infiltrated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are so dumb\Nand easy to manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, why am I in a cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a great day to be a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, what do you call yourself? I'm Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's have a welcome\Nparty for our new friend Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're throwing this party\Nin your honor, so eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the party, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:15:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep my eyes peeled for\Na chance to take back that chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll swipe all of Buggy's\Ntreasure, too, while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is such a flashy party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, it's time to prepare the buggy ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All set, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just observe the awesome might\Nof the buggy ball. Light it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was one heck of an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like it was one of the\Ncaptain's beloved buggy balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these buggy balls\Nand my Devil Fruit powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.79,0:16:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have no problem\Nconquering the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Nami? Right! Yes, of course! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's my destiny to\Nconquer the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I'm gonna become\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:17:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see why you're sick\Nof him, Nami! Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never takes anything seriously,\Nthinks that life's a big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He acts like a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about I give you a buggy\Nball to blow away your old boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a great opportunity for you to\Nprove your loyalty to me, your new captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's alright, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to finish him off quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the welcoming\Nparty and just have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my idea of having more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't shoot, I'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I do shoot, then I'm\Nno better than these pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fuse, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not wimping out on me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE! FIRE! FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hands are shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE! FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you take\Non pirates with half-ass resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE! FIRE! Resolve? To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To kill someone like it's nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a pirate's resolve? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE! FIRE! FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be willing\Nto risk your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, new chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit being such a tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me show you how to light the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mistake! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this outrage?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.03,0:19:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, now you've decided to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this for you, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.25,0:19:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to lower myself to\Nthe level of these inhuman pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates took the life of\Na person very dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never be one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nabi, the fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think pirates are just\Ninhuman filth, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get her, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water, water, water, water, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not very nice of you,\Nguns, to gang up on a poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.93,0:20:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and come get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you keep getting\Nyourself into these situations?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First a bird flies off with you, and\Nnow I find you trapped in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting story, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:21:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's, yeah, that little\Nbrat just called him Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew he mentioned earlier\Nwas the pirate hunter Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're here for my head, you've\Ngot quite a struggle before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave up pirate hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm interested, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing you would boast to my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.69,0:21:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you, but oh well
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't much of a\Nfight, now was it? Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.05,0:22:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Zoro! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are they laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their captain is lying dead on the\Nground and yet they're still laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.37,0:22:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fellas, what do you find so damn funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.07,0:22:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.57,0:22:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bucky's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chop-chop fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the Devil\NFruit that gave me my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a chop-chop person, and now I\Ncan never be defeated by the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His limbs re-attach?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I always thought that the devil fruits\Nwere just a story that pirates told.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.53,0:23:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's a chop-chop man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty freaky.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.98,0:23:25.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\blur1\bord0\c&HEFEFEF&\p1}m 501.75 837 l 949.5 837 949.5 945 501.75 945
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.98,0:23:25.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729,932)\blur0.8\bord0\fscx75\fscy75\fnVAG Rounded Std Light\c&H0C0B0D&}Rubber Person
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit any vital organs, but\Nthat's a serious wound you have there,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm guessing that I am the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.15,0:23:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tables have turned!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something quick,\Nthey're gonna kill all three of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.85,0:23:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:24:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stabbing him in the back was\Na cowardly move, you big nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call him that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.29,0:24:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.93,0:24:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a big nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.07,0:24:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.93,0:24:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M GONNA KICK YOUR ASS SOON\NAS I GET OUT OF THIS CAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.65,0:24:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU KICK MY ASS?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.41,0:24:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU 'VE GOT A LOT OF NERVE, KID!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.23,0:24:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NOW I'M AFRAID ALL THREE OF YOU\NARE GOING TO DIE HERE TODAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BY MY OWN HAND!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.23,0:24:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you're going to do any\Nass-kicking, you better do it soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.39,0:24:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.37,0:24:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.87,0:24:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, get up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.35,0:25:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better have a really good\Nplan or else we're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.57,0:25:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you guys gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.51,0:25:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes sense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.69,0:25:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.31,0:25:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.89,0:25:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.53,0:25:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your three-sword style has no effect\Non me, I already told you. I ne...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen what I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.69,0:25:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.05,0:25:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon's pointed at us! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.63,0:25:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Light it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.31,0:25:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do it now! Right! Wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.71,0:26:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon's still loaded\Nwith a special buckyball!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go out like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.11,0:26:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut in by my own balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you just did\Nthat, you ungrateful little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.75,0:26:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.69,0:26:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.13,0:26:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bad are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.73,0:26:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and don't\Nworry about how I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.15,0:26:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to concentrate if I'm\Ngoing to get us out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.61,0:26:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the girl? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.69,0:26:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's our new navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.25,0:26:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:26:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.11,0:27:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.97,0:27:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess even a lowly pirate\Ncan still rescue his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.53,0:27:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.79,0:27:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.55,0:27:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.19,0:27:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.39,0:27:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my\Ngrasp, and I wouldn't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.29,0:28:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.23,0:28:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges, I call out your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.75,0:28:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.63,0:28:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

